sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant DSA as DSA (sdr-ingest-transfer robot)
  participant EXP as /dor/export (NFS)
  participant RR as robots Redis
  participant PR as preservation_robots
  participant ST as Moab storage root
  participant PC as pres cat API
  participant PQ as pres cat Sidekiq

  DSA->>PC: signature_catalog (HTTPS JWT)
  DSA->>EXP: write Moab deposit bag for druid
  DSA->>RR: create preservationIngestWF, enqueue transfer-object
  RR->>PR: transfer-object
  PR->>ST: cp -rL bag to root/deposit/druid
  RR->>PR: validate-bag, then update-moab
  PR->>ST: ingest_bag writes vNNNN, verify
  RR->>PR: validate-moab
  PR->>PC: GET validate_moab with lane-id
  Note over PR: returns noop, step left started
  PC->>PQ: ValidateMoabJob on validate_moab_lane
  PQ->>ST: validate Moab and checksums
  PQ->>DSA: validate-moab completed or error (HTTPS)
  RR->>PR: update-catalog
  PR->>PC: POST or PATCH /v1/catalog
  PC->>PQ: enqueue ReplicationJob
  RR->>PR: complete-ingest
  PR->>DSA: accessionWF sdr-ingest-received completed
